en_words.txt is derived from en_GB_wordlist.combined.gz in the Android Open
Source Project's LatinIME (packages/inputmethods/LatinIME/dictionaries), built
by tools/keyboard/build_wordlist.py (non-words dropped, offensive words kept as
"never suggest", correction shortcuts filtered).

